e"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div><blockquote class="prose mt-2 text-xl leading-8 tracking-tight text-gray-600 sm:text-xl sm:leading-9"><p class="relative"><span>Cara <b>helps us find the right go-to-market sequences</b> before scaling, ensuring we focus on what works. She crafts personalized messages that reach the right contacts at the perfect time, addressing real customer pain points. Having her on our team feels like <b>working with a superhuman</b>!</span></p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-x-4"><img alt="Pascal van Dalen " loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gray-50 object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer6.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer6.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer6.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-sm leading-6"><div class="font-semibold text-gray-600">Pascal van Dalen </div><div class="text-gray-400">CEO at getgiffy.com</div></div></figcaption></figure></section></div><div class="pt-8 lg:pt-24"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl py-12" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="rounded-4xl absolute -inset-0 bottom-0 mx-auto hidden w-full sm:max-w-[1400px] lg:block overflow-hidden bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-stone-100/40 from-[28%] via-stone-200/10 via-[70%] to-stone-100/40 sm:bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))]"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url(&#x27;https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg&#x27;)] opacity-10" style="mix-blend-mode:overlay"></div></div><div class="relative px-4 lg:px-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 sm:gap-y-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div class="hidden sm:px-6 lg:block lg:px-0"><div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-slate-800 from-[28%] via-slate-700 via-[70%] to-slate-900 px-6 pt-8 sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-2xl sm:bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] sm:pl-10 sm:pr-0 sm:pt-10 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl sm:mx-0 sm:max-w-none"><div style="--width:2322;--height:1520" class="-mb-24 w-[52rem] max-w-none rounded-tl-xl bg-gray-800 ring-1 ring-white/10 relative aspect-[var(--width)/var(--height)] [--radius:theme(borderRadius.xl)]"><div class="absolute -inset-[var(--padding)] rounded-[calc(var(--radius)+var(--padding))] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/5 [--padding:theme(spacing.2)]"></div><img alt="Product screenshot" fetchPriority="high" width="2322" height="1520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full rounded-[var(--radius)] bg-white shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-black/10" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Fpipeline4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=90 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Fpipeline4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=90"/></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10 sm:rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl pl-0 lg:mx-0 lg:pl-2"><h2 class="flex items-center text-xs/5 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 data-[dark]:text-gray-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up mr-2 inline-block h-4 w-4 text-pink-600"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Success, Scaled</span></h2><h2 class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Scales what works</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">Cara automatically scales those campaigns that spark, delivering consistent results.</p><dl class="mt-6 max-w-xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 lg:max-w-none"><div class="relative pl-9"><dt class="inline font-semibold text-gray-900"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap absolute left-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 text-pink-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg>Autonomous workflow automation</dt> <dd class="inline">Cara streamlines your campaigns with intelligent, self-running workflows.</dd></div><div class="relative pl-9"><dt class="inline font-semibold text-gray-900"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-scatter absolute left-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 text-pink-600" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="5.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="11.5" cy="11.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="7.5" cy="16.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="14.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path></svg>Continuous learning and performance optimization</dt> <dd class="inline">Cara constantly improves, adapting strategies based on real-time results.</dd></div><div class="relative pl-9"><dt class="inline font-semibold text-gray-900"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox absolute left-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 text-pink-600" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg>Master Inbox and performance dashboard</dt> <dd class="inline">Centralized control and insights for all your campaign activities.</dd></div></dl></div><div class="mt-8 sm:hidden"><a href="/book-a-demo"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-semibold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-primary/20 text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 px-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-gray-700 to-gray-900 text-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone-call mr-4 h-5 w-5"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path><path d="M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94"></path><path d="M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10"></path></svg>Book a demo</button></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden pb-8 pt-24 lg:block"><section class="px-4 lg:px-0"><figure class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><p class="sr-only">5<!-- --> out of 5 stars</p><div class="flex gap-x-1 text-yellow-400"><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.