essful campaigns and automatically scales them</b>, delivering consistent results. Her autonomous workflows and real-time optimization keep everything running smoothly. With her continuous learning and centralized dashboard, we have <b>full control and insights at our fingertips</b>.</span></p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-x-4"><img alt="Pieter Boon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gray-50 object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer5.jpeg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer5.jpeg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer5.jpeg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-sm leading-6"><div class="font-semibold text-gray-600">Pieter Boon</div><div class="text-gray-400">Co-Founder ImpactPilot</div></div></figcaption></figure></section></div><div class="hidden pb-24 pt-40 lg:block" id="use-cases"><section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 lg:px-0"><h2 class="flex items-center text-xs/5 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 data-[dark]:text-gray-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-workflow mr-2 inline-block h-4 w-4 text-pink-600"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"></rect></svg><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Use cases</span></h2><h2 class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Cara builds and automates your most creative go-to-market ideas</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-full text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">Cara is the easiest-to-use, yet most advanced AI Sales Agent. Bring your custom prospecting, enrichment, research, and campaign workflow ideas to life today.</p><div class="rounded-4xl mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-stone-50/40 from-[28%] via-stone-100/70 via-[70%] to-stone-100/40 p-2 sm:bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] md:grid-cols-2"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-folder-input h-4 w-4 text-green-600"><path d="M2 9V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1"></path><path d="M2 13h10"></path><path d="m9 16 3-3-3-3"></path></svg><span>Custom Data</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">Personalized Outreach from Your Data</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara is the easiest-to-use, yet most advanced AI Sales Agent. Bring your custom prospecting, enrichment, research, and campaign workflow ideas to life today.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wand-sparkles h-4 w-4 text-purple-600"><path d="m21.64 3.64-1.28-1.28a1.21 1.21 0 0 0-1.72 0L2.36 18.64a1.21 1.21 0 0 0 0 1.72l1.28 1.28a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.72 0L21.64 5.36a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-1.72"></path><path d="m14 7 3 3"></path><path d="M5 6v4"></path><path d="M19 14v4"></path><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M7 8H3"></path><path d="M21 16h-4"></path><path d="M11 3H9"></path></svg><span>AI Research</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">Deep Web Research and Analysis</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara conducts deep web research to gather and summarize data, such as collecting pricing information across tiers and calculating averages, providing precise details for crafting personalized outreach messages.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database-zap h-4 w-4 text-pink-600"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 15 21.84"></path><path d="M21 5V8"></path><path d="M21 12L18 17H22L19 22"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 14.59 14.87"></path></svg><span>Multi-source data</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">Customizable multi-source data workflows</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara streamlines your lead generation by gathering contacts from sources like LinkedIn, Apollo, and Google Maps, consolidating them into a cohesive campaign, enabling efficient targeting without manual effort.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><img alt="Google Maps" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-maps.png&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-maps.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-maps.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/><span>Google Maps Data</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">Local Google Maps Prospecting</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara leverages Google Maps data to build targeted lead lists, using location insights to craft personalized messages that resonate with local prospects, helping you connect more effectively with nearby businesses.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><img alt="Google Search" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-search.png&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-search.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-search.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/><span>Web Search</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">Automated Google Search</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara automates web searches to gather key prospect details and detect purchase intent signals, such as product launches or job changes, helping you stay ahead with timely outreach based on the latest updates.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="text-card-foreground border shadow-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border focus:outline-none rounded-full text-sm px-2.5 py-[3px] bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 border-gray-600/20 gap-2 font-semibold"><img alt="Linkedin Logo" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-cluster%2Flinkedin.png&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-cluster%2Flinkedin.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-cluster%2Flinkedin.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/><span>Real-time  insights tracking</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><h3 class="text-primaryText mb-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter">LinkedIn Monitoring for Outreach Timing</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-600">Cara monitors your leads&#x27; LinkedIn activity to pinpoint key moments—such as job changes or engagement with relevant content—helping you time your outreach perfectly and craft messages with the right hook</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="hidden py-24 lg:block"><section class="px-4 lg:px-0"><figure class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><p class="sr-only">5<!-- --> out of 5 stars</p><div class="flex gap-x-1 text-yellow-400"><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.5)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div><blockquote class="prose mt-2 text-xl leading-8 tracking-tight text-gray-600 sm:text-xl sm:leading-9"><p class="relative"><span>Cara <b>automates our manual enrichment tasks</b> and does what we can't—like researching pricing pages from millions of websites to refine lead lists—while crafting personalized sales messages. This is beyond the capacity of our time-stretched SDRs. <b>Real superpowers</b>.</span></p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-x-4"><img alt="Jorge Moreno" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gray-50 object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer1.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcustomers%2Fcustomer1.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-sm leading-6"><div class="font-semibold text-gray-600">Jorge Moreno</div><div class="text-gray-400">Head of Growth</div></div></figcaption></figure></section></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white from-50% to-gray-100 py-24"><div class="relative isolate px-4 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-7xl"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -left-1/2 top-1/2 -z-10 -translate-y-1/2 transform-gpu overflow-hidden opacity-30 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ml-[max(50%,38rem)] aspect-[1313/771] w-[82.0625rem] bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#fff1be] from-[28%] via-[#ee87cb] via-[70%] to-[#b060ff]" style="clip-path:polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)"></div></div><h2 class="flex items-center text-xs/5 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 data-[dark]:text-gray-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers2 mr-2 inline-block h-4 w-4 text-pink-600"><path d="m16.02 12 5.48 3.13a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74L13 21.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-8.5-4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74L7.98 12"></path><path d="M13 13.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0L2.5 8.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74L11 2.26a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l8.5 4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74Z"></path></svg><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Generative Go-to-market</span></h2><h3 class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Cara understands your business and your customers&#x27; like no one else.</h3><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-rows-2"><div class="lg:rounded-4xl lg:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/5 data-[dark]:bg-gray-800 data-[dark]:ring-white/15"><div class="relative h-80 shrink-0"><div class="h-80 bg-[url(/bento/frame1.png)] bg-[size:390px_280px] bg-[left_30px_top_10px] bg-no-repeat"></div></div><div class="relative p-10"><h3 class="text-xs/5 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 data-[dark]:text-gray-400"><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Speed</span></h3><h4 class="font-display mt-1 text-2xl/8 font-bold text-gray-950">Built for power users</h4><p class="mt-2 max-w-[600px] text-sm/6 text-gray-600 group-data-[dark]:text-gray-400">With Cara, automating the most creative, high-performing outbound sales workflows has never been faster.</p></div></div><div class="lg:rounded-4xl lg:col-span-2 gro