arent">Limitless</span></h3><h4 class="font-display mt-1 text-2xl/8 font-bold text-gray-950">Access to Global Insights</h4><p class="mt-2 max-w-[600px] text-sm/6 text-gray-600 group-data-[dark]:text-gray-400">Cara taps into the vastness of online real-time insights, continuously learning and adapting based on the latest information.</p></div></div><div class="max-lg:rounded-4xl lg:rounded-4xl lg:col-span-3 group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/5 data-[dark]:bg-gray-800 data-[dark]:ring-white/15"><div class="relative h-80 shrink-0"><div class="h-80 bg-[url(/bento/frame2.png)] bg-[size:700px_330px] bg-[left_10px_top_15px] bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-50% group-data-[dark]:from-gray-800 group-data-[dark]:from-[-25%]"></div></div><div class="relative p-10"><h3 class="text-xs/5 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 data-[dark]:text-gray-400"><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Real-time Insight</span></h3><h4 class="font-display mt-1 text-2xl/8 font-bold text-gray-950">Cara Knows Your Customers&#x27; Needs</h4><p class="mt-2 max-w-[600px] text-sm/6 text-gray-600 group-data-[dark]:text-gray-400">Cara doesn&#x27;t stop at knowing you—she dives into your customers&#x27; world. She reads their websites, reviews, and news, understanding their pain points and opportunities.</p></div></div><div class="lg:rounded-4xl lg:col-span-3 group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/5 data-[dark]:bg-gray-800 data-[dark]:ring-white/15"><div class="relative h-80 shrink-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url(/bento/frame3.png)] bg-[size:800px_530px] bg-[left_-38px_top_-40px] bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-50% group-data-[dark]:from-gray-800 group-data-[dark]:from-[-25%]"></div></div><div cla