our sales team\u003c/b\u003e!\",\"authorName\":\"Phyllis Rush\",\"authorTitle\":\"GTM lead at Finch.com\",\"authorImageSrc\":\"/customers/customer17.png\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-8 lg:pt-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden pb-8 pt-24 lg:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"rating\":5,\"quote\":\"Cara \u003cb\u003ehelps us find the right go-to-market sequences\u003c/b\u003e before scaling, ensuring we focus on what works. She crafts personalized messages that reach the right contacts at the perfect time, addressing real customer pain points. Having her on our team feels like \u003cb\u003eworking with a superhuman\u003c/b\u003e!\",\"authorName\":\"Pascal van Dalen \",\"authorTitle\":\"CEO at getgiffy.com\",\"authorImageSrc\":\"/customers/customer6.jpg\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-8 lg:pt-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden pb-8 pt-24 lg:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"rating\":5,\"quote\":\"Cara \u003cb\u003etakes our successful campaigns and automatically scales them\u003c/b\u003e, delivering consistent results. Her autonomous workflows and real-time optimization keep everything running smoothly. With her continuous learning and centralized dashboard, we have \u003cb\u003efull control and insights at our fingertips\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"authorName\":\"Pieter Boon\",\"authorTitle\":\"Co-Founder ImpactPilot\",\"authorImageSrc\":\"/customers/customer5.jpeg\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden pb-24 pt-40 lg:block\",\"id\":\"use-cases\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden py-24 lg:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"rating\":5,\"quote\":\"Cara \u003cb\u003eautomates our manual enrichment tasks\u003c/b\u003e and does what we can't—like researching pricing pages from millions of websites to refine lead lists—while crafting personalized sales messages. This is beyond the capacity of our time-stretched SDRs. \u003cb\u003eReal superpowers\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"authorName\":\"Jorge Moreno\",\"authorTitle\":\"Head of Growth\",\"authorImageSrc\":\"/customers/customer1.png\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gradient-to-b from-white from-50% to-gray-100 py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative isolate px-4 lg:px-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-7xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-x-0 -left-1/2 top-1/2 -z-10 -translate-y-1/2 transform-gpu overflow-hidden opacity-30 blur-3xl\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-[max(50%,38rem)] aspect-[1313/771] w-[82.0625rem] bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#fff1be] from-[28%] via-[#ee87cb] via-[70%] to-[#b060ff]\",\"style\":{\"clipPath\":\"polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-layers2 mr-2 inline-block h-4 w-4 text-pink-600\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1cuww1\",{\"d\":\"m16.02 12 5.48 3.13a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74L13 21.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-8.5-4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74L7.98 12\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"pdlvxu\",{\"d\":\"M13 13.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0L2.5 8.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74L11 2.26a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l8.5 4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d6008e] from-[28%] via-[#c7008f] via-[70%] to-[#8109B8] bg-clip-text text-transparent\",\"children\":\"Generative Go-to-market\"}]],\"data-dark\":